# Implementation Plan - Modernizing Store and Admin UI

This plan outlines the steps to overhaul the design of Set pages, Card pages, and the Admin Dashboard using the established "Coolex Aesthetic" (Glassmorphism, Outfit Typography, Vibrant Red Accents).

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This change will modify the layout of the Admin Dashboard and Inventory pages. While the functionality remains identical, the visual appearance will shift from a standard data-grid look to a more premium, card-based aesthetic.

## Proposed Changes

### 1. Global CSS Audit & Enhancement
#### [MODIFY] [modern.css](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/assets/css/modern.css)
- Ensure all color variables (`--primary-red`, `--dark-bg`, etc.) are correctly defined.
- Add utility classes for "Tiny Uppercase Eyebrows" and "Premium Shadows".
- Refine `.glass-card` to match the exact radius (`1.25rem`) and shadow profile.

---

### 2. Store: Set & Card Pages
Apply the design system to all TCG category views to ensure a unified customer experience.

#### [MODIFY] [view_set.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/view_set.php) (and other set views)
- Update headers to use `font-weight: 800` and `Outfit` font.
- Refine card grid spacing (`g-4`) and internal card padding.
- Modernize the "No Stock" empty state.

#### [MODIFY] [view_card.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/view_card.php) (and other card views)
- Clean up the image gallery layout.
- Use "Eyebrow" labels for metadata (Rarity, Set, Price).
- Standardize the "Add to Cart" form with `.modern-btn-primary`.
- Improve the "Card Details" spec table with a cleaner card layout.

---

### 3. Admin: Dashboard & Inventory
Rebuild the admin experience to feel like a premium management suite.

#### [MODIFY] [admin/index.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/admin/index.php) (Dashboard)
- Replace custom `.stat-card` and `.cat-card` with the global `.glass-card`.
- Update background to `#f8f9fa`.
- Use the "Good morning" header pattern from the design system.

#### [MODIFY] [admin/pokemon_inventory.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/admin/pokemon_inventory.php) (and other inventory pages)
- Wrap tables in `.glass-card`.
- Modernize task buttons (Edit/Delete) to match the `.modern-btn-sm` style.
- Standardize search bars and filters.

#### [MODIFY] [admin/sidebar.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/admin/sidebar.php)
- Update colors to match the Red/Dark/White theme.
- Enhance hover states with subtle glassmorphism effects.

## Open Questions

- Should we keep the "Live Market Price" feature prominently displayed in the admin inventory, or focus purely on shop prices for management?
- Are there any specific admin-only pages (like Manage Orders) that you want prioritized for this redesign?

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- N/A (UI Changes)

### Manual Verification
1.  **Storefront:** Navigate through Pokémon, MTG, and One Piece sets/cards to ensure consistent padding and typography.
2.  **Admin Panel:** Verify the dashboard stats are readable and the inventory tables are correctly contained within glass-cards.
3.  **Responsive Check:** Ensure all grids collapse correctly on mobile (2 columns for cards, 1 column for admin stats).
